 "about": "The real proof batch of the plugin 1.4.0 batching step (23 October 2026), made by `explainer-film-place variations make --keys dials.cracks_and_chips.crack_density dials.cracks_and_chips.crack_width_metres dials.cracks_and_chips.chip_amount amount.cracks_and_chips --range dials.cracks_and_chips.crack_density 0.6 1 --range amount.cracks_and_chips 0.6 2 --count 10 --seed 12`: the cracks and chips of the finished canal lock of the first smoke test, two cameras. The free scout here (240 x 160, 38 s) found all 10 measurably different; on the rented cards (3 jobs at once, 600 x 400, Cycles 24 samples on RTX 4090s) all 10 came out measurably different too, in 178 card seconds (about US$0.05, an estimate, not a bill). Two earlier files on the same scene were scouted first and each had one pair too alike (density 0.5 to 1 with seed 11, and 0.6 to 1 with seed 11); they never went to a card. Names show each of the first two settings as a percent of its whole range: crackwid25 = a quarter of the way from 0.002 to 0.05 m (not 25 mm). Write your own file for your own scene.",
